  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Swan Song**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-08-30** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 124 min [1]. Said about its sound: Features a double-time boogie intro and includes other double-time boogie sections; Incorporates musical bits from Boogieman Sam and Ice V within the track; Includes bits of Dragon and concludes with a reprise of Swan Song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-08-30**: taped by Chris Cage; transferred by Chris Cage; source: ccm41v>femto>sd744 24/48 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps CCM 41V mics, K5LU preamp, and SD 744 recorder [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by HCCA: [King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard | Harrah's Cherokee Center - Asheville](https://www.harrahscherokeecenterasheville.com/events/2024-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard/) [3]\n- Fan art by Jason Galea Standard Edition: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-08-30 ExploreAsheville.com Arena, Asheville, NC, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-august-30-2024-exploreashevillecom-arena-asheville-nc-usa.html) [4]\n- Poster by Any Thing Records, LLC: [King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard - Live in Asheville, NC 08/30/2024 (Third Color Edition) — Any Thing Records, LLC](https://www.anythingrecordsllc.com/shop/p/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-asheville-nc-08022024) [5]",
